&lt;p&gt;At AutoProff, we&#39;re looking for a new colleague&amp;nbsp;to help manage and develop our supplier and transport network across Europe. This is a hands-on role with a mix of operational and commercial responsibilities, where you&#39;ll work closely with suppliers and colleagues across the business to ensure our operations run smoothly and efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our new Senior Transport Manager, you will be responsible for managing supplier relationships, monitoring operational performance, and ensuring our supplier and transport network supports our business across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with internal teams and external suppliers to ensure reliable supplier performance, support day-to-day operations, and identify opportunities to improve the way we work. While you&#39;ll be involved in supplier and transport contracts, you&#39;ll collaborate closely with &lt;strong&gt;AutoScout24&#39;s Procurement team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;,&lt;/strong&gt; who lead the commercial negotiations and sourcing activities, ensuring a consistent procurement approach across the group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position can be based at our headquarters in &lt;strong&gt;Vejle, Denmark&lt;/strong&gt;, or at our office in &lt;strong&gt;Düsseldorf, Germany&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let&#39;s dive into your key responsibilities, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the daily collaboration with suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor supplier performance and service level agreements (SLAs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up on delayed orders and resolve operational issues together with suppliers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate transport vendors to ensure efficient logistics operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain supplier rebate and kickback agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approve supplier invoices in Coupa.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support claims and handle supplier escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure suppliers comply with contractual agreements and internal processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve processes and reduce costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain supplier data, dashboards, KPIs, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Procurement, Operations, Finance, Customer Support, and other internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The need-to-have skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of experience in Supplier Management, Procurement, Logistics, Transport Management, or a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with transport providers and logistics operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing supplier performance and service level agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and the ability to use data to support decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ERP or procurement systems (experience with Coupa is an advantage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage several tasks and priorities at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional proficiency in English and German or Danish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The nice-to-have skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience from an international technology, marketplace, automotive, or e-commerce company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with transport sourcing and freight procurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience handling supplier claims and disputes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with dashboards and KPI reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy working with both operational tasks and commercial discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build good working relationships with suppliers and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Like solving problems and finding practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a structured way and follow tasks through to completion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are comfortable taking responsibility and making decisions within your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you think we could be a match, we&#39;d love to hear from you. Apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AutoProff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AutoProff was founded in 2013 by the experienced car dealer Jesper Ratza in Denmark. The aim was to digitalise B2B used car trading, helping car dealers increase sales and improve profits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;in August 2022, AutoScout24, the leading specialised pan-European online car marketplace, acquired a majority stake in AutoProff. The partnership has supported the rapid expansion of AutoProff&#39;s solutions across Europe and enables the creation of Europe&#39;s first fully integrated C2B-B2B-B2C dealing solution for used cars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At AutoProff, we specialise in providing online B2B used-car dealing solutions designed to improve the buying and selling experience for professional car dealers and their customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With a focus on effective solutions, digitisation and customer service, we are committed to being the home of B2B car dealing for European dealers, including trade-ins cars, retail-ready cars, newer used fleet vehicles and insurance write-offs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the emerging European leader with more than 150,000 B2B used cars on our online trading platforms annually. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Muck Rack is trusted by thousands of organizations around the world to understand how their brands show up across news, social media and AI-generated answers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our AI-powered platform connects the entire PR workflow in one place, helping communications teams manage media relationships, understand the conversations shaping their brands, take action and measure their impact. Combined with analyst-led Media Intelligence and advisory services, Muck Rack turns signals into insights and insights into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founder-controlled and growing&amp;nbsp; profitably and sustainably, we have the freedom to build forward-thinking products, put our customers first, and offer an inclusive culture that welcomes diverse perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Agents team at Muck Rack is building AI for PR and communications professionals. Our first agent helps customers understand their media coverage. Next, we’re building agents that can plan and carry out multi-step workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take features from idea to production, working across our Python agent runtime, MCP server, and Django/Vue application. You’ll help decide how the technology works, ship it to real customers, and learn from how they use it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help shape what we build next and how we build it. You’ll work with new models, solve real customer problems, and take your ideas from experiment to production. If you want to build agents people actually rely on, we’d like to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build agents that take action.&lt;/strong&gt; Build tools, prompts, guardrails, and multi-turn workflows with memory. Help agents know when to act, ask a question, or hand off to a human&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship the full experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Build in-product chat, streaming responses, permission-aware APIs, and our external MCP server&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make quality measurable.&lt;/strong&gt; Build evals, catch regressions, and use production feedback to improve quality, latency, and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help shape the platform.&lt;/strong&gt; Make decisions about how we build, deploy, and run agents as the product grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Be Set Up for Success in This Role, You&#39;ll Need to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years building production software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent Python skills, including async programming and experience with FastAPI, FastMCP, or Django&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping LLM-powered features or agents to real customers including exposing tools via MCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of prompting, tool use, context management, and where models go wrong&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience measuring AI quality and using what you learn to improve it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong API and tool design skills, including authentication and authorization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively incorporates AI tools into day-to-day work to improve productivity and accelerate delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working-hour overlap with US time zones (Eastern preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If Any of the Below Also Describe You, This Could Be an Exciting Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agent frameworks such as Pydantic AI, LangGraph, or the OpenAI Agents SDK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MCP servers and LLM tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI evaluation tools and methods, including DeepEval and LLM-as-judge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Streaming UIs, server-sent events, and Vue.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LLM observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI security, including prompt injection defenses and tenant isolation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Below you&#39;ll find an outline of the interview plan for this role. Please note that this is what we expect the process to look like; we may ask you for supplemental information or require an additional step before making a final decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute interview with a member of our Talent Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 1 hour zoom interview with the hiring manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer interviews with several team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Executive Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute Bar Raiser&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel &amp;amp; Team Engagement Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires up to 10% travel for team collaboration, customer engagements, and company events. As part of our commitment to building strong connections across our fully distributed team, attendance at our annual company offsite (typically held in Mexico) is expected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;108&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in Ireland is €95,000–€110,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role in United Kingdom is £105,000–£115,000 annually, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;110&quot; data-end=&quot;211&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary for this role in Bulgaria is €6,500+ gross per month, depending on experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual compensation decisions are based on a number of factors, including experience level, skillset, and balancing internal equity relative to peers at the company. We expect the majority of the candidates who are offered roles at our company to fall healthily throughout the range based on these factors. We recognize that the person we hire may be less experienced (or more senior) than this job description as posted. If that ends up being the case, the updated salary range will be communicated with you as a candidate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Muck Rack?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
