&lt;li&gt;Sponsor and oversee engagements run day to day by Engagement Managers, with multidisciplinary teams of consultants, data scientists and data/AI engineers, and ensure the quality of what we deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure delivery meets regulatory requirements: GxP, validation of AI systems, Swiss FADP/GDPR and the EU AI Act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for client satisfaction, project margin and team experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop our knowledge base&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak and publish on AI in life sciences, for example GenAI in medical and regulatory writing, AI in clinical operations, HCP engagement, and AI governance under GxP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn our Swiss life sciences work into references and case studies, and bring them into Artefact’s global practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire and develop consultants with life sciences experience, train the wider Swiss team on the domain, and own staffing on your engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–15 years of experience, including 8+ years serving pharma, biotech or medtech clients at a life sciences–focused consultancy or the life sciences practice of a strategy or technology firm. A later move in-house is welcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently Director, Principal or Associate Partner with a personal sales target, ready for the step to Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of origination with life sciences clients: you can name clients you opened yourself and the revenue you sold, beyond extending existing accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A network among decision-makers in the Swiss life sciences industry, especially in Basel and Zurich, that you are actively growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of GxP and computer system validation, and how they apply to data and AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working fluency in data and AI: you can discuss what an AI use case needs from data, what it costs and when it pays back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English. German is a strong advantage, French a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in or willing to relocate to the Zurich area, with regular travel to Basel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape what comes next: the Swiss practice has proven itself and is growing fast. It is still small enough that you shape its clients, its offers and its team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell with a global platform: you bring the credentials, delivery capacity and AI assets of a 2,500-person firm into every proposal, and you work with industry leads across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy to production under one roof: our consultants and engineers work in the same teams, so your clients get from recommendation to working solution without changing firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture: innovation, collaboration and action shape how we work. Artefact Switzerland is Great Place to Work certified (2026).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurship: you are measured on the clients, revenue and team you build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Payroll Specialist owns end-to-end Dutch payroll, operated in Nmbrs, and acts as the designated backup for the company’s other international payrolls. This role harmonizes, simplifies, and continuously improves payroll execution and payroll accounting across the company’s Dutch entities, pay groups, providers, and systems. This is to make sure payroll remains accurate, compliant, trusted, and understandable as the company grows without a proportional increase in manual work or risk. As international backup, the role maintains working proficiency in the company’s other country payrolls and provides continuity during peak periods, absences, and year-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end Dutch payroll execution in Nmbrs across entities and pay groups: monthly and off-cycle runs, holiday allowance, year-end close and annual statements (jaaropgaven), and the payroll calendar; define consistent execution standards that meet Dutch statutory and contractual requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Dutch payroll tax and social security compliance: wage tax and national insurance contributions (loonheffingen), employee insurance and Zvw premiums, the work-related costs scheme (WKR), timely and accurate loonaangifte to the Belastingdienst, corrections, and resolution of Belastingdienst and UWV correspondence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Administer regulated and complex pay items accurately: the 30% ruling and other expatriate and cross-border arrangements, equity income (RSU/option) taxation, pension contributions and provider files, sick leave and statutory leave schemes, transition payments and termination settlements, wage garnishments (loonbeslag), and taxable benefits-in-kind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run and reconcile shadow payrolls in Nmbrs for internationally mobile employees (inbound assignees, cross-border and remote workers, and outbound Dutch employees with a host-country shadow payroll)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the designated backup for the company’s other international payrolls: maintain working knowledge of country calendars, providers, and controls, and run or support pay cycles during absences, peak periods, and year-end in coordination with the payroll owners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead root-cause analysis for recurring payroll, accounting, or service failures; design and implement durable fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive process harmonization and simplification to reduce manual steps, handoffs, rework, and off-cycle runs; make full use of Nmbrs functionality, integrations, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead payroll execution during transitions (new entity launches, provider or system changes, restructures/M&amp;amp;A), ensuring continuity and control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure payroll accounting remains clean as scope changes: consistent journals, accruals, reversals, and reconciliation standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor preventative controls by design, including SOX-aligned payroll controls; improve evidence pack quality and audit readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as escalation owner for complex or sensitive pay issues; provide authoritative explanations to employees and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR Ops, Finance, Legal/Compliance, Nmbrs, and international payroll providers to deliver scalable operating models and service quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 7+ years of Dutch payroll experience, including multi-entity scope in complex environments (growth, change, or hybrid in-house/outsourced models).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on Nmbrs experience: running payroll end to end, configuring wage components and journal mappings, managing loonaangifte and corrections, and using its reporting and integrations (HRIS, GL, pension and benefits providers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep working knowledge of Dutch payroll compliance: loonheffingen and social security, WKR, the 30% ruling, expatriate taxation and shadow payroll, pension administration, sick leave and statutory leave, termination settlements, and year-end reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of international payroll (running or overseeing outsourced country payrolls) and readiness to act as the designated backup for the company’s other payrolls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong payroll controllership skills: ability to design controls, enforce SoD/approvals, and ensure audit-ready evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven capability improving payroll processes (standardization, automation enablement, reducing manual effort and errors) and leading transitions (vendor/system/new entity) with structured planning and issue resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong payroll accounting knowledge and experience working with Finance during close and audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management; comfortable acting as an escalation owner and payroll authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and professional working proficiency in Dutch (statutory correspondence, legislation, and provider documentation are in Dutch).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;It will be an added bonus if you have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dutch payroll qualification (PDL and/or VPS) and/or Nmbrs certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with international payroll providers or aggregators and multi-country operating models (SLAs, KPIs, remediation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating payroll controls in a SOX-compliant, US-listed company environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with equity compensation payroll (RSUs/options), including cross-border cases and trailing tax liabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Global Mobility programs: shadow payroll set-up, tax equalization/protection and hypothetical tax, gross-ups, and year-end assignee reconciliations with tax advisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience turning statutory/operational requirements into system/workflow requirements (e.g., Nmbrs–HRIS–GL integrations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management certification or comparable experience leading cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Competencies &amp;amp; Behavioral Traits:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinking: redesigns the process so it scales, rather than adding checks and manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias for prevention: anticipates issues and builds guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence without authority; can align multiple stakeholders around standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and change; makes decisions with incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reliability and ownership: a dependable backup who keeps continuity across payrolls when it matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coaching mindset; elevates capability across the payroll team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Are you looking for an exciting part-time job alongside your studies? Want to apply analytical theory to high-impact, real-world business projects?&amp;nbsp;Take on the challenge and apply today!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Business Analyst Tech Working Student&lt;/strong&gt; at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This role is all about driving impact—you’ll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that push boundaries and redefine the grocery shopping experience. You’ll join a dynamic and collaborative team in a fast-paced, innovative environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solving real-life puzzles: &lt;/strong&gt;Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day. Curious about the questions?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enabling: &lt;/strong&gt;Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Create and optimize models for real-time improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicating: &lt;/strong&gt;Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning your projects&lt;/strong&gt;: Take initiative by challenging the status quo and rethinking how things are done. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in a &lt;strong&gt;Master’s program&lt;/strong&gt; in Computer Science, Information Systems, AI, Data Science, Mathematics, Econometrics or equivalent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with &lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;SQL,&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Python&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for &lt;strong&gt;data analytics,&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI, &lt;/strong&gt;and&lt;strong&gt; business consulting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to explain &lt;strong&gt;complex analytical concepts&lt;/strong&gt; in a comprehensible manner to various stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in both written and verbal &lt;strong&gt;English &lt;/strong&gt;and have an &lt;strong&gt;EU citizenship&lt;/strong&gt; available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Available for minimum &lt;strong&gt;16h per week&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;minimum 4 months&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your performance, we can discuss further opportunities at Picnic!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Where you can make an impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt; – Optimize the backbone of our operations, from fulfillment centers to last-mile delivery and demand forecasting across Europe. Think: automating international delivery forecasts for growth markets like France.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech&lt;/strong&gt; – Build scalable backend systems, cutting-edge AI workflows, and internal tooling that power our entire platform. Think: building AI agent workflows (using Python, Claude, and SQL).&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consumer&lt;/strong&gt; – Drive customer growth and strategic category development across our markets. Think: optimizing search algorithms for recipe discovery and running deep-dive analyses on customer retention and membership strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Why Picnic&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow as we grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;From day one, you’ll take ownership of real business projects that affect millions of customers, gaining hands-on experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn from top minds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work alongside driven, talented mentors in a high-energy environment. You&#39;ll build, solve problems, and celebrate together, from our legendary Friday drinks to team events and parties.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kickstart your career.&lt;/strong&gt; Earn a competitive student salary with flexible working hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll have plenty of chances to grow, whether it’s through our casual Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions or team specific trainings. We’re especially keen on keeping great talent around: perform well as a working student, and we would love to explore&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;transitioning you into a full-time role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials. &lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

