&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📆 All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_kit__blocks c-message_kit__blocks--rich_text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message__message_blocks c-message__message_blocks--rich_text&quot; data-qa=&quot;message-text&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer&quot; data-qa=&quot;block-kit-renderer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper p-block_kit_renderer__block_wrapper--first&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Reddit is a community of communities. It’s built on shared interests, passion, and trust, and is home to the most open and authentic conversations on the internet. Every day, Reddit users submit, vote, and comment on the topics they care most about. With 100,000+ active communities and approximately 130 million daily active unique visitors, Reddit is one of the internet’s largest sources of information. For more information, visit &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.redditinc.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://redditinc.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.redditinc.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working as a Senior Growth Manager supporting Reddit’s International Community team, you will develop and execute initiatives that strengthen Reddit’s user and community ecosystems in the US and across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is open to candidates based in the UK or the US - East Coast.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a marketing role. You will identify high-impact growth opportunities, design and execute experiments, and develop successful interventions into repeatable models that can be applied across markets. Your work may include building and scaling communities, increasing the supply of relevant content and contributions, reaching underserved audiences, and strengthening Reddit’s user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines growth strategy, hands-on experimentation, data analysis, and cross-functional influence. You will work closely with Product, Data Science, Marketing, and Community teams while maintaining the autonomy and entrepreneurial mindset required to scale successful initiatives to other markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User &amp;amp; Community Growth Strategies: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish and execute comprehensive strategies to grow the user base and nurture communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth Experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute growth experiments aimed at addressing gaps in content supply, community density, contribution, discovery, engagement, and user growth. Apply a creative, entrepreneurial approach by testing ideas quickly, learning from results, and iterating accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling and Repeatability:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate successful experiments into repeatable playbooks, processes, and recommendations that can be applied across markets. Determine which elements can scale broadly, which require local adaptation, and what operational or product support is needed to unlock broader impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance Analytics: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor key growth and ecosystem indicators, including DAU, contribution, content supply, community health, and retention. Analyze performance trends, identify risks and opportunities, and establish clear measurement frameworks for experiments and scaled programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with various internal teams to provide insights, shape priorities, and scale growth initiatives. Build compelling evidence through experimentation to influence cross-functional investment and product development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in user growth, product operations, or market expansion, with a demonstrated track record of executing growth initiatives at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong entrepreneurial instincts, hands-on execution skills, and the ability to make progress independently in ambiguous or resource-constrained environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven and analytical mindset, with proficiency in Excel modeling, working knowledge of SQL, and experience creating scalable processes and automations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, with the ability to distinguish between market-specific problems and growth opportunities that can be addressed through repeatable approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively and align cross-functional stakeholders across global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented mindset, strong attention to detail, and a bias toward execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort balancing a portfolio of opportunities across the US and international markets and prioritizing based on potential impact, feasibility, and strategic relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;In select roles and locations, the interviews will be recorded, transcribed and summarized by artificial intelligence (AI). You will have the opportunity to opt out of recording, transcription and summarization prior to any scheduled interviews.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;During the interview, we will collect the following categories of personal information: Identifiers, Professional and Employment-Related Information, Sensory Information (audio/video recording), and any other categories of personal information you choose to share with us. We will use this information to evaluate your application for employment or an independent contractor role, as applicable.&amp;nbsp; We will not sell your personal information or disclose it to any third party for their marketing purposes.&amp;nbsp; We will delete any recording of your interview promptly after making a hiring decision.&amp;nbsp; For more information about how we will handle your personal information, including our retention of it, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://redditinc.com/policies/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy for Potential Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reddit is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, and is committed to building a workforce representative of the diverse communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; Reddit is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities and disabled veterans in our job application procedures. If, due to a disability, you need an accommodation during the interview process, please let your recruiter know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;m_8972703100365155930Ltr m_8972703100365155930OutlineElement m_8972703100365155930SCX45225805&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are currently seeking a talented and driven sales professional who will bring the Internet of Things to mid-sized customers, building Samsara&#39;s business and bringing the benefits of sensor data to customers. Typical sales will be £20k to £200k, and typically involve technical POCs, multiple stakeholders, multi-faceted pricing negotiations, and selling to executives and CXOs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates based in United Kingdom. Relocation assistance will not be provided for this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Your efforts will result in real-world impact—helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mantra is #alwaysbeprospecting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; The world of operations is vast. Your customers are often out in the field and the best way to catch them is live on the phone. Samsara’s top reps do constant research to find companies and contacts to expand their pipeline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have innate curiosity in how businesses work:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; One day you’ll meet with someone in waste management and the next you may be learning about the inner workings of a food distribution center. Our top sales team members seek to learn the ins and outs of the businesses they support in order to make a larger impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build genuine relationships with your customers: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The industries we serve have relied on pen-and-paper solutions for years and haven’t been met with the type of technology we offer. Our customers value earned trust and human relationships built over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 300;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Samsara’s high-performance Sales culture means you’ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go farther than you have before.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This may not be the right role for you if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You aren’t willing to put in the work: &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara sales are complex. You will need to learn about businesses where you previously had little knowledge. The payoff is big but you have to be willing to put in the work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You aren’t a team player: &lt;/strong&gt;At Samsara, sales is a team sport. We help each other out by &lt;strong&gt;sharing best practices and focus on winning as a team.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have nothing more to learn&lt;/strong&gt;: Every Samsarian has a growth mindset and believes that what got us here won’t get us there.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a pure hunter role focused on 90% net-new logo acquisition,&quot;&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;&quot;Candidates must have a minimum of 24 months&#39; experience in a full-cycle, outbound-heavy SaaS closing role.&lt;/em&gt;Work on strategic account mapping &amp;amp; outbound prospecting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Own customer engagements end-to-end, from prospecting and qualification to close&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work collaboratively with a team of internal / cross-functional stakeholders to remove deal blockers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a pure hunter role focused on 80-90% net-new logo acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 24 months&#39; experience in a full-cycle, outbound-heavy SaaS closing role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proven track record of consistent quota over-achievement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Experience handling complex mid-large deal cycles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value-based selling approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills and curious by nature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfortable in a dynamic, customer facing environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;MEDDIC experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Excited about solving new problems in innovative ways&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Highly collaborative with a growth mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a ---------- or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in ----- ----- or ----- For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Our Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a dynamic and customer-focused &lt;strong&gt;Solutions Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Commercial team in Zurich. This role is ideal for a professional who enjoys combining business insight with technical expertise to help clients solve complex challenges. As a key partner to our Sales, Product, and Operations teams, you will play a critical role in designing tailored solutions, accelerating sales cycles, and ensuring successful customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct discovery sessions with prospective clients to understand business processes, challenges, and technical requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex client needs into effective solution designs and technical specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and present tailored solutions leveraging our product capabilities and integration options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling product demonstrations, presentations, and proof-of-concept workshops for clients and stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the sales team as a technical and functional expert throughout the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and contribute to RFI and RFP responses, ensuring accuracy and alignment with customer expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide effort estimations and implementation guidance for proposed solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product Development, Operations, and Implementation teams to ensure solution feasibility and successful delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather customer feedback and market insights to support product innovation and strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop sales enablement materials, technical documentation, and case studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Logistics/Supply Chain Management, Computer Science, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Solutions Consultant, Business Implementations, Presales Engineer, Solution Architect, or a similar customer-facing role within enterprise software, SaaS based environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of supply chain management, logistics, or related industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CRM platforms and project management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with integration technologies such as APIs and ETL processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent written and spoken English, other language skills are beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role will be measured through:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality and customer-focused solution designs and proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective support of the sales process resulting in accelerated deal closure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer satisfaction with demonstrations, presentations, and proposed solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accuracy and completeness of RFI/RFP responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful collaboration across Commercial, Product, Implementation, and Operations teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous contribution to product improvement through market and client insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increased conversion of qualified opportunities into successful customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You Should Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work with innovative technology solutions in a dynamic commodity trading environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to international clients and complex business challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and entrepreneurial company culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct impact on business growth and customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close interaction with senior stakeholders and industry experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and career growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exciting role at the intersection of technology, consulting, and commercial strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you are passionate about solving business challenges, working with clients, and delivering innovative solutions that create real value, we&#39;d love to hear from you. Apply today and join our team as a Solutions Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>
